  "title": "UI: Change formatString() to show localized byte units as per Wireshark language preference",
  "description": "**Currently, before this change**, using English as manually selected language in Wireshark, Version 4.1.0rc0-3296-g9708362cee37:\n\n![image](/uploads/8b2afcae6c9e2278d98111602294bd31/image.png)\n\n= Wireshark still uses whatever language settings are used in the OS level (here: Finnish) regardless of Wireshark settings.\n\n\n**After this change** (with the same OS and Wireshark settings):\n\n![image](/uploads/ead8deb2980ea7afa39b76b2adf66a49/image.png)\n\n= Wireshark uses the language or system default according to Wireshark settings.\n\n\nSource: See the discussion in [QTBUG-82831](https://bugreports.qt.io/browse/QTBUG-82831).",
